      "widgets_values": [
        "Analyze the attached reference images and videos.\n\nReference mapping (SLOT FORMAT):\n- Image 1: Character / subject reference\n- Image 2: Costume / outfit / product reference\n- Image 3: Prop / accessory / secondary subject reference\n- Image 4: Environment / scene / background reference\n- Image 5: Product / brand / commercial element reference\n- Image 6: Style / aesthetic / mood / material reference\n- Image 7: Creative / freeform / composite reference (optional)\n- Image 8: Continuation frame — the exact ending frame from the previous segment (labeled 8-LAST). This MUST be used as the precise visual starting point.\n\nTask: Generate a Seedance 2.0 video prompt for a 15-second CONTINUATION segment (Segment 2).\n\nThis segment continues the action from where the previous 15-second segment ended.\n\nCRITICAL CONTINUITY INSTRUCTIONS:\n- The very first timestamp (00:00.0) MUST begin with the word 'CONTINUE:' followed by an explicit description of the character's pose, hand positions, facial expression, and product placement as shown in Image 8.\n- Do NOT invent a new pose — describe what is literally visible in Image 8.\n- Character appearance, outfit, hair, and accessories must be identical to the previous segment.\n- Product placement and lighting must remain consistent.\n- Environment and camera style should feel continuous.\n\nOutput format: Two-part prompt wrapped in [[PROMPT]] / [[/PROMPT]] tags. Part 1 is flowing prose. Part 2 is a precise 0.5s timestamped motion timeline from 00:00.0 to 00:14.5. NO arc labels anywhere.",
